        "answer": {
          "short": "$145.9^\\circ$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\cos\\angle ABC&=\\frac{15^2+8^2-9.5^2}{2(15)(8)}\\\\[8pt]\\angle ABC&=\\cos^{-1}\\left(\\frac{53}{64}\\right)\\\\[8pt]\\text{Bearing of }C\\text{ from }B&=180^\\circ-\\cos^{-1}\\left(\\frac{53}{64}\\right)\\\\[8pt]&\\approx145.9^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 23
      },
      {
        "id": "nr-p29-q6b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "The bearing of campsite $A$ from campsite $C$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$208.2^\\circ$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\cos\\angle BAC&=\\frac{15^2+9.5^2-8^2}{2(15)(9.5)}\\\\[8pt]\\angle BAC&=\\cos^{-1}\\left(\\frac{67}{76}\\right)\\end{align*}$$\nReverse bearings differ by $180^\\circ$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Bearing of }A\\text{ from }C&=180^\\circ+\\cos^{-1}\\left(\\frac{67}{76}\\right)\\\\[8pt]&\\approx208.2^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 35
      }
